# Source files: LF everywhere, whatever the OS's autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Provenance-pinned files must keep their exact bytes: schemas/SOURCE.md publishes their
# SHA-256, and the audit trail records it. Never let git rewrite their line endings.
schemas/*.xsd -text
schemas/*.wsdl -text
output/* -text

# Binary documents
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
